# Bilingual documentation (RU + EN)

- All project docs are **bilingual in the same file**. Do not create `*.ru.md` / `*.en.md` twins.
- Convention: bilingual headings (`Title / Заголовок`); body as paired **RU.** / **EN.** blocks (or equivalent clear pairing). Tables may use bilingual Notes cells or paired note lines.
- After **every** documentation change (status, roadmap, README, ADR, contracts, etc.), update **both** languages in that file before finishing the task.
- Canonical language policy note: `docs/DOC_LANGUAGE.md`.
- Code identifiers, paths, env vars, and API routes stay as-is (not translated).
